  "title": "Crab Dip",
  "description": "This crab dip recipe is easy to make with canned crabmeat, cream cheese, and onion; serve hot in a warm bread bowl for a pleasing party appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Laurie O'Grady"
  ],
